    narr:narration """Dave Quantum’s recent communications center on a [decisive shift in infrastructure](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786871836804_1), specifically the migration of the analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB. This transition is framed through a combination of [authoritative declarations](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786871836804_3) and [rational performance justifications](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786871836804_2). The discourse is marked by a high degree of technical focus, emphasizing [expected performance gains](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786871836804_4) and a [concrete delivery timeline](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1786871836804_5) set for Q3 2026. The voice remains consistent in its matter-of-fact register, treating the migration not as a proposal under debate, but as a settled operational trajectory.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1786871836804_1> ;
